	int "Additional heap memory pool size for Serial Modem"
	default 3072 if NRF_PROVISIONING
	default 1700 if SM_NRF_CLOUD
	default 0
	help
	  modem_jwt library used by nrf_cloud libraries, uses kernel heap for querying UUID.
	  2x CONFIG_MODEM_JWT_MAX_LEN is the maximum it can use.
	  nrf_provisioning uses over 2kB of heap.

