config SM_PPP
	bool "PPP support"
	help
	  Adds support for PPP.
	  This option is enabled by the PPP overlay.
	  PPP can be used in conjunction with :option:`CMUX <CONFIG_SM_CMUX>` in order to use a
	  single UART for both AT data and PPP.
	  When CMUX is also enabled, PPP is usable only through a CMUX channel.
	  See :ref:`SM_AT_PPP` for more information.

